  "idea": "AppFlowy: the open-source Notion replacement that stays local",
  "text": "You can organize your entire business and projects in a free open-source dashboard. Entrepreneurs often juggle multiple paid apps just to handle task tracking, documentation, and sprint roadmaps. Disconnected subscriptions drain your monthly budget and scatter critical project assets across separate platforms. AppFlowy centralizes your wikis, timelines, and database views into one customizable, local workspace for free. You eliminate subscription bloat and streamline daily focus.",
